## Authentication
Custom Token (bx-umidtoken) — Authentication method detected from captured traffic.

### Providing credentials
- Prefer passing auth as request headers or cookies at call time (do not hardcode secrets into the skill).
- If executing via an external proxy/executor, pass per-call credentials (cookies and/or headers) so they are not persisted.

## Dependencies
- Runtime capable of HTTPS requests.
- If using `scripts/api.ts`: TypeScript toolchain (or transpile to JS).

## Endpoints

### Data Read (10)
- `GET /{id}` — Retrieve item details by ID.
- `GET //h5/mtop.alibaba.fc.api.maoxland.containerfacade.singleview/1.0/_____tmd_____/punish` — Retrieve single view container punish data.
- `GET /alilog/` — Retrieve alilog data.
- `GET /code/lib/` — Get code library files.
- `GET /h5/{h5Id}/1.0/` — Retrieve data for a specific H5 page.
- `GET /h5/mtop.alibaba.fc.api.maoxland.containerfacade.singleview/1.0/_____tmd_____/{_____tmd_____Id}` — Retrieve single view container data by ID.
- `GET /h5/mtop.relationrecommend.wirelessrecommend.recommend/2.0/` — Get product recommendations.
- `GET /sd/punish/0.0.4/program.wasm` — Download WebAssembly program.
- `GET /trace/trace/1.3.22/` — Retrieve tracing information.
- `GET /w/wu.json` — Get WU configuration data.

### Data Write (3)
- `POST /{id}` — Update item details by ID.
- `POST /h5/mtop.relationrecommend.wirelessrecommend.recommend/1.0/` — Submit recommendation request.
- `POST /service/um.json` — Submit UM data.

### Search (1)
- `GET /wow/z/tbhome/default/kissy-search-suggest-iframe` — Get search suggestions.

### Config (1)
- `GET /alilog/configs/sdk/common.json` — Fetch common SDK configuration.

